{
 "about": "Kingdom v6, the short run a script can check: two nights of 26 seconds, days of 34. The villagers and the Greed are complex creatures and the fighting is the platform's (health, hit boxes, a projectile). The script picks up the ten starting coins, recruits two citizens, makes one the builder and one a knife thrower, builds the wooden wall and stands behind it. The horn: the citizens' places empty, the thrower walks to its post behind the wall. Night 1, two single Greed, a crude cleaver in the hand: they walk to the wall, are given it and hack at it from their line before it, hopping back after every blow (KG_PUNCH 25, KG_WALL_HP going down from 200), while the thrower's knives hit them (KG_THROW, KG_KNIFE, KG_KILL). Dawn: the builder walks to the wall and hammers it whole (KG_MEND, KG_WALL_HP going up, KG_MENDED); the script collects the morning's four coins, recruits a citizen and makes it a soldier at the barracks. Night 2 (bursts of 2, 2 and 1): the soldier stands in front of the wall and leaps at the Greed it notices (KG_SLASH 40); it may fall (KG_DOWN soldier). The second dawn wins. Prints to expect, in order: KG_READY, KG_DAY, KG_COINS 1..10, KG_CITIZEN x2, KG_BUILDER, KG_THROWER, KG_WALL 1, KG_WARN, KG_DUSK 1, KG_GREED x2, KG_AT_WALL, KG_PUNCH / KG_WALL_HP, KG_THROW / KG_KNIFE / KG_KILL, KG_DAWN, KG_INCOME 4, KG_MEND ... KG_MENDED, KG_COINS, KG_CITIZEN, KG_SOLDIER, KG_WARN, KG_DUSK 2, KG_GREED x3, KG_SLASH, KG_DAWN, KG_VICTORY. KG_POOR / KG_NEED mean a station refused. Whether it is fun is for a person to say; this run only shows that every part works. During both nights it takes two screenshots a second, 2560 wide: playtest_frames over seconds 39-55 and 93-118, cropped to the wall, shows every blow frame by frame (what is in the hands, when it lands). The full game is kg6_play.json: day 60, night 45, five nights. An option shows no text on an account of 奇匠 level 1, only its icon, so prices are rows of small coins above the stations.",
